# Local HTML demos

When composing or rebuilding an example page from SPIRION MCP (prompt pack, compose-brief, generate):

- Write a **single standalone HTML file** under `tmp/` (gitignored).
- Inline CSS. Put images next to the file or use a relative path that works with `file://`.
- Open that file in the browser. Do not add Next.js routes, `paths.ts` copy, island deploys, or AppShell chrome unless the user explicitly asks to ship it into the product.
